## Architecture — 4-Layer (Strict)

```
internal/
├── api/                          # Layer 1: HTTP Transport
│   ├── handler/                  # Parse request → call orchestrator → return response
│   ├── middleware/                # Auth, logging, recovery, request ID
│   └── orchestration/            # Layer 2: Coordinate multiple services
├── domain/                       # Interfaces + entity structs
│   ├── interfaces.go             # All service/repo/cache interfaces
│   ├── entities.go               # {{ join .Entities ", " }} entities
│   └── mocks/                    # Generated mocks (mockgen)
├── service/                      # Layer 3: Business logic
{{ range .Entities }}│   ├── {{ lower . }}_service.go
{{ end }}├── repository/                   # Layer 4: Database access (Bun ORM)
{{ range .Entities }}│   ├── {{ lower . }}_repository.go
{{ end }}└── infrastructure/               # External adapters
    ├── database/                 # PostgreSQL connection
{{ if .HasRedis }}    ├── cache/                    # Redis client
{{ end }}{{ if .HasRabbitMQ }}    └── queue/                    # RabbitMQ client + publishers
{{ end }}
```

**Layer Rules:**
- Handler NEVER calls Repository directly
- Repository NEVER contains business logic
- Service NEVER imports `net/http`
- Orchestrator coordinates services — no direct DB access

