## Rules

- `zerolog` for ALL logging — no `fmt.Println`, no `log` package
- Errors wrapped: `fmt.Errorf("operation: %w", err)`
- Interfaces in `internal/domain/interfaces.go` — define before implementing
- Context propagation: `context.Context` as first parameter
- Conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `test:`, `refactor:`, `chore:`
- Files under 300 lines
- No hardcoded secrets — always `${ENV_VAR}` in config
